SCOPE — READ THIS BEFORE REUSING ANYTHING

The MIT grant above covers the SOFTWARE ONLY: the GDScript source, scenes,
tools, tests, and build tooling in this repository.

It does NOT cover, and cannot cover:

1. SFPUC archival photographs and documents (`assets/art/archival/`).
   These are third-party materials held by the San Francisco Public Utilities
   Commission and are used here by permission. Rights are recorded per file in
   `assets/art/archival/CREDITS.md`. They are not redistributable under MIT and
   must not be assumed to be reusable.

2. Any third-party font, audio, or artwork added later. Each carries its own
   licence, recorded alongside it.

Historical content in `content/cards/` is authored for this project. Facts are
not copyrightable; the specific wording is. Reuse of the prose is granted under
the MIT terms above, but the source notes should travel with it — the whole
point of that layer is traceability.
